AMIX: 060 speed-ups found with prsample (2026-11-08)

- ioapi.c: 16 KB stdio buffer for pk3s (AMIX buffers 1 KB; the zip code reads
  directories a byte at a time)
- tr_image.c: R_RMSE in integers with early exit; the low-memory RMSE pass only
  when r_lowMemTextureSize is set
- tr_local.h, tr_shade*.c: 32-bit sine-table indexes (int64_t conversions are
  libgcc software routines on the 060)
- msg.c: the message Huffman trees from a table made on the PC (amix/huffgen),
  27 s of the 060's start-up otherwise

